@startuml
actor User
participant CLI
participant "Install Emacs\nOrchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "Environment\nDetector" as EnvironmentDetector
participant "Emacs\nDetector" as EmacsDetector
participant "Method\nRecommender" as MethodRecommender
participant "Text\nRenderer" as Renderer

User -> CLI : emacs-a11y install emacs
CLI -> Orchestrator : run(guidance_only)
Orchestrator -> EnvironmentDetector : detect_environment()
EnvironmentDetector --> Orchestrator : platform + architecture
Orchestrator -> EmacsDetector : detect_emacs()
EmacsDetector --> Orchestrator : found/missing + path + version
Orchestrator -> MethodRecommender : recommend(environment, emacs_state)
MethodRecommender --> Orchestrator : recommendation
Orchestrator -> Renderer : render_guidance(...)
Renderer --> CLI : INFO/WARNING/COMMAND/NEXT STEP
CLI --> User : textual linear output
@enduml